---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Scientific Library"
  description="The PeptiBloom Scientific Library is a public research resource built to make evidence, uncertainty, provenance and unanswered questions inspectable."
>
  <section class="library-hero">
    <div class="library-shell library-hero__grid">
      <div class="library-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Scientific Library</p>
        <h1>Explore.<br />Learn. <em>Grow.</em></h1>
        <p class="library-hero__lead">A curated scientific library built to make evidence, uncertainty, provenance and unanswered questions easier to inspect.</p>
        <div class="library-hero__features" aria-label="Library content types">
          <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H11v16H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 21.5zM20 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 17.5 3H13v16h4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 20 21.5z"/></svg><small>Monographs<br />and fact sheets</small></span>
          <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h10.6A2 2 0 0 0 19 18l-5-9V3M8 15h8"/></svg><small>Scientific<br />reviews</small></span>
          <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 3h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16H5V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM8 7h8M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg><small>Clinical<br />studies</small></span>
          <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4h12v16H6zM9 8h6M9 12h6M9 16h4"/></svg><small>Patents and<br />technical data</small></span>
        </div>
        <div class="library-search" aria-label="Library search placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6"/><path d="m16 16 4 4"/></svg><span>Search peptides, topics or keywords...</span></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="library-hero__visual">
        <div class="library-hero__art"><img src="/brand/editorial/web-assets/card_library.png" alt="Scientific books, botanical leaves and molecular structure representing the PeptiBloom Scientific Library" /></div>
        <figcaption><span>Evidence · limits · provenance</span><strong>Knowledge should be inspectable.</strong></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="library-principles" aria-labelledby="library-principles-title">
    <div class="library-shell">
      <div class="library-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Library principles</p><h2 id="library-principles-title">Every entry should make four things visible.</h2></div>
        <p>Evidence is more useful when its boundaries remain visible.</p>
        <a class="principles-link" href="/methodology/">About our approach <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="library-principles__grid">
        <article><div class="principle-top"><span>01</span><span class="principle-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H11v16H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 21.5zM20 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 17.5 3H13v16h4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 20 21.5z"/></svg></span></div><h3>Evidence</h3><p>What the available research can support — without extending beyond it.</p></article>
        <article><div class="principle-top"><span>02</span><span class="principle-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16H5V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM8 7h8M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg></span></div><h3>Uncertainty</h3><p>What remains theoretical, disputed, incomplete or unknown.</p></article>
        <article><div class="principle-top"><span>03</span><span class="principle-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="5.5"/><path d="m15 15 4.5 4.5"/></svg></span></div><h3>Provenance</h3><p>Where information comes from and how a reader can trace it back.</p></article>
        <article><div class="principle-top"><span>04</span><span class="principle-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18M5 7h14M7 7l-3 6h6L7 7Zm10 0-3 6h6l-3-6ZM8 21h8"/></svg></span></div><h3>Contradictions</h3><p>Where sources or findings do not align cleanly.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="library-publication" id="publication-state" aria-labelledby="current-library-title">
    <div class="library-shell library-publication__grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Current publication state</p><h2 id="current-library-title">No placeholder compounds.<br /><em>No fabricated evidence.</em></h2><p>Compound-level scientific pages appear only after the approved evidence and publication path is complete. Until then, a visible gap is better than invented certainty.</p><a class="library-link" href="/methodology/">Read the methodology →</a></div>
      <aside class="library-path"><p class="surface-kicker">Publication path</p><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Scientific Inventory</strong><small>Sources and review workflow</small></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Evidence</strong><small>Public contract required</small></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Public Library</strong><small>Production-ready content only</small></div></li></ol></aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="library-available" aria-labelledby="learn-now-title"><div class="library-shell library-available__inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Available now</p><h2 id="learn-now-title">Start with the literacy layer.</h2><p>Research Basics explains recurring concepts around COAs, HPLC, sterility, cold chain, lyophilization and related technical literacy without presenting those articles as compound monographs.</p></div><a class="library-cta" href="/research-basics/">Explore Research Basics <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.library-shell{width:min(calc(100% - 3rem),92rem);margin-inline:auto}.library-hero{padding:clamp(1.8rem,3.8vw,4rem) 0 2.5rem;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#fcfafc 100%);overflow:hidden}.library-hero__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(26rem,.88fr) minmax(33rem,1.12fr);gap:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,4.5rem);align-items:center}.library-hero__copy .eyebrow{margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--color-lavender-deep);letter-spacing:.18em}.library-hero__copy h1{max-width:9ch;margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(3.7rem,6vw,6.6rem);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-weight:500}.library-hero__copy h1 em{color:#5f4cc4;font-weight:400}.library-hero__lead{max-width:35rem;margin:0;color:#454a67;font-size:clamp(1.08rem,1.5vw,1.34rem);line-height:1.45}.library-hero__features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;max-width:40rem;margin-top:1.55rem;padding-top:1.2rem;border-top:1px solid #ebe6f0}.library-hero__features span{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6rem 1fr;gap:.5rem;align-items:start;color:#4d526e;font-family:var(--font-system)}.library-hero__features svg,.principle-icon svg{width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem;fill:none;stroke:#6655c8;stroke-width:1.55;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.library-hero__features small{font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.3}.library-search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;max-width:34rem;margin-top:1.35rem;padding:.8rem 1rem;border:1px solid #e4dfeb;border-radius:.75rem;background:#fff;color:#8a8ca0;box-shadow:0 .25rem 1rem rgba(67,53,91,.05);font:400 .85rem var(--font-system)}.library-search svg{width:1.2rem;height:1.2rem;fill:none;stroke:#4f4a79;stroke-width:1.6}.library-hero__visual{position:relative;margin:0;min-height:clamp(27rem,37vw,36rem)}.library-hero__art{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 58% 44%,rgba(193,180,255,.32),transparent 30%),radial-gradient(circle at 78% 48%,rgba(212,235,219,.25),transparent 34%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0) 0%,rgba(245,242,251,.9) 24%,rgba(239,236,249,.97) 100%)}.library-hero__art img{position:absolute;right:-2%;bottom:3%;width:104%;max-width:none;filter:drop-shadow(0 24px 24px rgba(73,54,98,.14))}.library-hero__visual figcaption{position:absolute;right:1.6rem;bottom:1.5rem;max-width:17rem;padding:.9rem 1rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.8);border-radius:.9rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.76);backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}.library-hero__visual figcaption span,.library-hero__visual figcaption strong{display:block}.library-hero__visual figcaption span{font:600 .67rem var(--font-system);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6655c8}.library-hero__visual figcaption strong{margin-top:.3rem;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.25}
.library-principles{padding:3rem 0 3.4rem;border-top:1px solid #eeeaf2;background:#fff}.library-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(16rem,.62fr) auto;gap:2rem;align-items:end;margin-bottom:1.65rem}.library-heading h2{max-width:15ch;margin:.3rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(2.45rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:.98}.library-heading>p{max-width:24rem;margin:0;color:#555a75;font-size:1.08rem}.principles-link{align-self:end;padding:.65rem 1.1rem;border:1px solid #ded7ea;border-radius:999px;color:#5f4cc4;font:600 .8rem var(--font-system);text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.principles-link span{margin-left:.55rem}.library-principles__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.library-principles__grid article{min-height:12rem;padding:1.3rem 1.35rem;border:1px solid #e8e3ee;border-radius:1rem;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#fff 0%,#faf7fc 100%);box-shadow:0 .45rem 1.4rem rgba(61,49,83,.05);overflow:hidden}.library-principles__grid article:nth-child(2){background:linear-gradient(150deg,#fff,#f1ebf8)}.library-principles__grid article:nth-child(3){background:linear-gradient(150deg,#fff,#f7f2fa)}.library-principles__grid article:nth-child(4){background:linear-gradient(150deg,#fff,#f3eff9)}.principle-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.principle-top>span:first-child{font:600 .72rem var(--font-system);color:#6655c8}.principle-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(111,82,209,.08)}.principle-icon svg{width:1.35rem;height:1.35rem}.library-principles__grid h3{margin:.7rem 0 .35rem;font-size:1.42rem}.library-principles__grid p{max-width:19rem;margin:0;color:#5d6076;font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.42}
.library-publication{padding:3.3rem 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfafc,#f6f2f9)}.library-publication__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(20rem,.72fr);gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);align-items:center}.library-publication h2{margin:.3rem 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(2.65rem,4.8vw,4.8rem);line-height:.96}.library-publication h2 em{color:#5f4cc4;font-weight:400}.library-publication p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:47rem;color:#555a75}.library-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:.75rem;color:#5f4cc4;font:600 .92rem var(--font-system);text-decoration:none}.library-path{padding:1.7rem;border:1px solid #e5deeb;border-radius:1.2rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.74);box-shadow:0 .45rem 1.5rem rgba(61,49,83,.06)}.library-path ol{margin:1rem 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}.library-path li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.4rem 1fr;gap:.75rem;padding:.9rem 0;border-top:1px solid #e9e4ee}.library-path li>span{font:600 .7rem var(--font-system);color:#6655c8}.library-path strong,.library-path small{display:block}.library-path strong{font-size:1rem}.library-path small{margin-top:.15rem;color:#6d7084;font:400 .78rem var(--font-system)}
.library-available{padding:2.8rem 0;background:#fff}.library-available__inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:2rem;align-items:center}.library-available h2{margin:.25rem 0 .55rem;font-size:clamp(2.25rem,3.8vw,3.7rem);line-height:.98}.library-available p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:60ch;color:#5d6076}.library-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:.8rem 1.25rem;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6046c8,#7a56d4);color:#fff;font:500 .92rem var(--font-system);text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.library-cta:hover{color:#fff}
@media(max-width:980px){.library-hero__grid,.library-publication__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.library-hero__visual{min-height:28rem}.library-hero__art img{width:92%;right:2%}.library-principles__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.library-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.principles-link{justify-self:start}.library-available__inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start}}
@media(max-width:640px){.library-shell{width:min(calc(100% - 2rem),92rem)}.library-hero__copy h1{font-size:clamp(3.15rem,15vw,4.8rem)}.library-hero__features{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.library-hero__visual{min-height:21rem}.library-hero__art img{width:118%;right:-12%}.library-hero__visual figcaption{position:static;margin-top:.8rem}.library-principles__grid,.library-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
